        why: 'At beginner level, most games are decided by one-move tactical oversights rather than opening theory.',
        doThis: ['Complete 100 mixed tactical puzzles.', 'Reach 70%+ accuracy across your latest 30 puzzles without using hints.'],
        examples: ['Winning a queen with a knight fork; spotting a pinned defender.'],
